  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f95" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Milne Pipeline Company&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Notes to the Financial Statements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Milne Point Pipeline, LLC does not pay corporate income taxes.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Harvest Alaska, LLC., as managing member, handles the administrative affairs of the limited liability company and has also been contracted to operate and maintain the facilities of Milne Point Pipeline, LLC.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.10in;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;NOTE 1&amp;#8211; BALANCE SHEET&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;At March 31, 2026, the provision for the asset retirement obligation for the Milne Point oil and gas pipelines was $8,069,769.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The provision has been estimated using existing technology, at current prices and is expected to be incurred over the next 13.75 years.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;While the provision is based on the best estimate of future costs and the economic lives of the pipelines, there is uncertainty regarding both the amount and timing of incurring these costs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 10;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;width: 4.47in;"&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.20in;"&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: bottom;width: 126.1pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: bottom;width: 17.15pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 93.6pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;1Q 2026&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.